{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wuzhu-e-o086a","title":"孙权南郊称帝改元追尊孙坚吴氏孙策立孙登皇太子","accounts":[{"id":"wuzhu-e-o086a-account","label":"《吴主传第二》正文","text":"孙权南郊称帝改元追尊孙坚吴氏孙策立孙登皇太子","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o086a-q"]},{"id":"houzhu-a-split-e842720b4b0f","label":"《后主传》正文","text":"孙权称帝后与蜀汉结盟","evidence":["houzhu-q-O020"]},{"id":"houzhu-a-split-ca4a6a51e709","label":"《后主传》正文","text":"孙权与蜀汉和亲通好","evidence":["houzhu-q-O006"]},{"id":"dongliu-a-ecc2cddc7963e623f5ea","label":"正文","text":"孙权称尊号","evidence":["dongliu-q-bd768d8595cb7388681c"]},{"id":"shiyi-a-e39de2c72791b7c90f24","label":"正文","text":"于是孙权称尊号，因瑞改元","evidence":["shiyi-q-966398998f0d8fb4555f"]},{"id":"wufan-a-5f877bd48c436d60996a","label":"裴注·吴书","text":"孙权即尊号","evidence":["wufan-q-dc90eefb5bc5740902be"]}],"participants":[{"person":"sun-quan","role":"称帝","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o086a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0119","role":"被追尊","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o086a-q"]},{"person":"zhouyu-p0018","role":"被追尊","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o086a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0099","role":"被追封","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o086a-q"]},{"person":"zhouyu-p0025","role":"立皇太子","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o086a-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":229,"label":"四月丙申","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"wuzhu-y229","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"wuzhu-q-o084","basis":"四月丙申"},"evidence":["wuzhu-e-o086a-q","wuzhu-q-o084","zhuge-q-o036","zhuge-q-b-2cd6c12d0155d7b41caf"]},"ordering_evidence":"wuzhu-e-o086a-q","source_order":[47,445,"O086a"],"order":8287}],"persons":[{"id":"sun-quan","name":"孙权","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0099","name":"孙策","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0119","name":"孙坚","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"zhouyu-p0018","name":"孙权母（本篇未具名）","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"zhouyu-p0025","name":"孙登","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"dongliu-q-bd768d8595cb7388681c","section":"chapter-039","block":"b-b276806059ddb2996f31","layer":"original","quote":"七年〖2〗，孙权称尊号","section_title":"董刘马陈董吕传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0084.xhtml","index":113,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":20,"end":31},{"id":"houzhu-q-O006","section":"chapter-033","block":"b-cb536ff095e1397ab4d3","layer":"original","quote":"是岁，立皇后张氏〖9〗。遣尚书（郎）邓芝固好于吴；吴王孙权与蜀和亲使聘〖10〗，是岁通好。","section_title":"后主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0072.xhtml","index":18,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":45},{"id":"houzhu-q-O020","section":"chapter-033","block":"b-3db637064ae5b25f000e","layer":"original","quote":"冬，亮徙府营于南山下原上〖2〗；筑汉、乐二城〖3〗。是岁，孙权称帝，与蜀约盟：共交分天下〖4〗。","section_title":"后主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0072.xhtml","index":52,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":48},{"id":"shiyi-q-966398998f0d8fb4555f","section":"chapter-062","block":"b-10e858eec5c942f4e431","layer":"original","quote":"于是权称尊号，因瑞改元","section_title":"是仪胡综传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0131.xhtml","index":66,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":13,"end":24},{"id":"wufan-q-dc90eefb5bc5740902be","section":"chapter-063","block":"b-c5889490acc554489cec","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝一﹞《吴书》曰：“初，权即尊号，令达算‘作天子之后，当复几年’？达曰：‘高祖建元十二年；陛下倍之。’权大喜，左右称‘万岁’。果如达言。”","attribution":"《吴录》","section_title":"吴范刘惇赵达传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0133.xhtml","index":108,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-23ae4ebce99532b82d2b","start":0,"end":69},{"id":"wuzhu-e-o086a-q","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-ebc4a5309375a1b590a7","layer":"original","quote":"丙申〖2〗，南郊即皇帝位〖3〗。﹝一﹞是日大赦，改年；追尊父破虏将军坚为武烈皇帝，母吴氏为武烈皇后，兄讨逆将军策为长沙桓王；吴王太子登为皇太子；将吏皆进爵加赏。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_000.xhtml","index":444,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":80},{"id":"wuzhu-q-o084","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-83e35f5ca74d8a53a1d7","layer":"original","quote":"黄龙元年春，公卿百司皆劝权正尊号〖1〗。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_000.xhtml","index":442,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":20},{"id":"zhuge-q-b-2cd6c12d0155d7b41caf","section":"chapter-035","block":"b-2cd6c12d0155d7b41caf","layer":"modern","quote":"〖21〗七年：建兴七年（公元 229）。","section_title":"诸葛亮传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0076.xhtml","index":240,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-6aef03116ccf2e720e54","start":0,"end":20},{"id":"zhuge-q-o036","section":"chapter-035","block":"b-019120a2568f2b0d74c9","layer":"original","quote":"七年〖21〗，亮遣陈式攻武都、阴平。魏雍州刺史郭淮率众欲击式，亮自出至建威〖22〗；淮退还，遂平二郡。","section_title":"诸葛亮传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0076.xhtml","index":217,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":51}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
